# The 2D demo, reached by wrapping upward from the first entry. It was the third
# menu entry when this was written and is the fourth since N1 added the digit
# screen before it; UP from entry 0 still lands on it, which is why this script
# did not change.
frame 1 down UP
frame 2 up UP
frame 2 down ENTER
frame 3 up ENTER
frame 3 down P
frame 4 up P
frame 4 down SPACE
frame 5 up SPACE
frame 5 down SPACE
frame 6 up SPACE
frame 6 down R
frame 7 up R
frame 7 down ESCAPE
frame 8 up ESCAPE
frame 8 down Q
